    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d62">

                <pb facs="0125" n="75" xml:id="pg75"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-06-10"><hi rendition="#italic">June 10, 1894</hi></date>.
                        (Received July 14.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 246.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your telegram of the 6th instant, with regard to the refunding of certain
                    duties collected by the Government of Brazil on wheat flour.</p>
                <p>I have brought this matter to the attention of the Government, as directed, and
                    am awaiting a reply.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thos. L.
                    Thompson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
